!Series_summary = Kaposi’s sarcoma-associated herpesvirus (KSHV) causes the B cell malignancy primary effusion lymphoma (PEL). Here we performed mRNA sequencing to characterize the mRNA expression profile of the primary effusion lymhoma (PEL) cell line BC-1.
